        <body>
            <div xml:id="d905">

                <pb facs="0856" n="752" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg752"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/6451.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Consul General at Monterey to the Secretary
                        of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate General</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Monterey</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-03-02">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 2, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The State of Coahuila is in revolt. City of Saltillo quiet but entirely cut off
                    by rail, mail and telegraph for more than a week.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hanna</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
